  "description": "Build or verify a reproducible release of sourced on-chain credit events, with venue-native records, mapping provenance and explicit coverage. Use when the user names Tabularium, asks to preserve a credit-event record, or wants to rebuild or verify a Tabularium release offline. This version maps preserved Aave v4, Euler v1 and Euler V2 credit events, maps deployed Wildcat V1/V2 from verified Alexandria raw releases, and rebuilds a non-canonical Compound v3 Phase 0 execution witness and a bounded Wildcat V1/V2 archive view. Do not use it to collect live data, infer who controls an address, rate a counterparty, authenticate a publisher or claim an independently proved chain boundary.",
